AUDIO: 'If you scroll TikTok or Instagram Reels, you\'ve probably seen a lot of videos that use a lot of motion graphics and animations to go along with the video. For example, this is an Instagram Reel I posted the other day. You can see there is motion graphics, fades, and animations, and you may have thought how'

[00:13] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'the hell are people making these animations for every single video and posting every single day. I mean, I was thinking the exact same thing before. Because if you have any video editing experience, then you know how difficult'

[00:25] [scene:talk]
