AUDIO: 'it is to create even the simplest of animations. Well, here\'s a little secret. If they\'re not using a dedicated video editor, then they\'re most likely using Claude. More specifically, they\'re using the Hyperframes skill with Claude, and in this video, I\'m going to show you'

[00:39] [scene:talk]
